  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">龙珠Z RPG邀请您在Minecraft中体验终极动漫RPG冒险，力量通过训练、变身和激烈战斗获得。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">受龙珠宇宙启发并由DragonMineZ模组支持，这个模组包结合了变身、能量战斗、探索、成长、Boss战和多人联机动作，为您带来史诗级的龙珠Minecraft体验。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">龙珠Z RPG是一款冒险、RPG和战斗导向的模组包，以DragonMineZ为核心，并扩展了增强战斗、成长、结构、维度、战利品和电影式战斗的模组与附加组件。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>🔷 解锁强大的变身：</strong><br>训练您的战士，解锁受龙珠宇宙启发的标志性变身。提升您的力量等级，进化您的能力，随着旅程的进行变得更强壮。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>⚡ 掌握气功技能和战斗技巧：</strong><br>使用强大的能量攻击、能力、飞行机制和战斗技能击败敌人。每场战斗都需要时机把握、策略和对您气功力量的掌控。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>👾 击败Boss和传奇敌人：</strong><br>在世界各地的强力Boss和标志性敌人面前作战。为越来越困难的战斗做好准备，这些战斗将奖励成长、升级和新能力。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>🏰 探索结构、维度和新冒险：</strong><br>前往危险地点，发现隐藏区域，探索新结构，揭开充满敌人、战利品和挑战的秘密。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🎮 <strong>RPG和多人联机体验：</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">独自或与朋友一起游玩，组建您的英雄团队，创建您自己的龙珠RPG服务器，共同面对Boss和挑战。</span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>准备好和朋友一起游玩了吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore%253fr%253ddragonball\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">现在就启动您的Minecraft服务器，与朋友们开启史诗级冒险！享受强大的性能、稳定的运行时间和无压力的体验。别忘了使用代码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VOXELCORE</a>为您的服务器享受<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">25% off</a>优惠！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></a></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
